OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over HMP Wandsworth's
OL,4,Aheating failures
OL,5,
OL,6,FInmates at Wandsworth Prison are being
OL,7,Fheld in "inhumane living conditions",
OL,8,Faccording to a report which also
OL,9,Fhighlighted recurring problems with
OL,10,Fheating and hot water.
OL,12,FThe Independent Monitoring Board (IMB)
OL,13,Fsaid the prison suffered a "loss of
OL,14,Fservice" affecting the heating in
OL,15,FNovember last year. Temperatures at the
OL,16,F170-year-old Category B prison can fall
OL,17,Fas low as 12C.
OL,19,FDuring the outage, an additional 1,500
OL,20,Fcoats, 1,000 blankets and 2,000
OL,21,Fpackages of instant soups and noodles
OL,22,Fwere ordered for inmates.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
