OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over HMP Wandsworth's
OL,4,Aheating failures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report warned the prison's
OL,7,Funreliable heating and hot water supply
OL,8,Fwould remain an issue until the system
OL,9,Fwas fully replaced, rather than being
OL,10,F"patched up in a piecemeal manner".
